        "text": "- Issues\n- Propositions\n- News\n- Guiding Principles\n- About\n  - Contact Us\n  - Why Am I Running?\n  - Meet Arthur\n- Yard Signs\n- Volunteer\n- Contribute\nYes, I really was on a podcast. Watch me with IndependentJoe on YouTube. See the News tab.\n### Hello, I am Arthur Webb and I am running for California State Assembly, District 15.\nMy campaign joins others across the State to give frustrated Californians an alternative.\nI am moderate, NPP, Independent, who believes that voters still control our nation. I will receive no money from either major party, nor will I ask. This is the election in which moderate voters of all parties can take back California. I know we can find a better balance in Sacramento.\nThe Democratic party has controlled California for decades and that has hurt our State. One party rule, regardless of the party, is not what the Founders intended. They warned against \"permanent factions\" becoming shadow governments not responsive to voters. Enough already! I believe that a better blend of Democrats and Republicans, with other parties and independents, will lead to more collaboration, better legislation, smaller government, and more focus on the average citizen. Similar messages are resonating throughout the State. Now is the time. Let’s do it. Join us for a better California.\n- Stop the incessant tax increases, which target working people\n- Stop the gas tax, diesel tax, and the need for school bonds\n- Re-establish balanced and limited state government\n- Re-establish election integrity\n- Reduce regulatory barriers to housing\n- Reduce homelessness where possible\n- Stop the rampant fraud, waste, and corruption\n- Stop letting state government tell us how to live\nWe must emphasize compassionate quality of daily living for people of all demographics and all walks of life, starting with citizens and taxpayers.\nWe must reclaim our personal \"Freedom to Choose\" life as we see fit.\nWe must return to common sense policies, not vaguely defined aspirational goals.\n### Bookmark and return for frequent updates.\nSign Up for Updates\nFirst name Last name Email Zip/Postal Message\nThanks for signing up!\nSupport Our Campaign Contribute Today\nClick Here to Contribute\nJoin the Campaign Become a Volunteer\nClick Here to Sign Up\nShow Your Support Request a Yard Sign\nClick Here to Request a Sign\nNeed Voting Information?\nRegister & Find Your Polling Location\nClick Here for Information\n- District 15 Map\n- Voter Information\n- Contact Us\n- Privacy Policy\nPaid for by Arthur Webb for Assembly 2026 FPPC #1490039\nPowered by CampaignPartner.com\n- Home\n- Issues\n- Propositions\n- News\n- Volunteer\n- Contribute\n- Guiding Principles\n- Contact Us\n- Why Am I Running?\n- Meet Arthur\n- Yard Signs\n- Voter Information\n- District 15 Map\nClose Menu",
